# Generic markdown styling

## Bold
**Lorem** ... ...

... **Ipsum** ...

... ... **Something**

## Italic
*Lorem* ... ...

... *Ipsum* ...

... ... *Something*

## Bold italic
***Lorem*** ... ...

... ***Ipsum*** ...

... ... ***Something***

## Underline
__Lorem__ ... ...

... __Ipsum__ ...

... ... __Something__

## Strikethrough
~~Lorem~~ ... ...

... ~~Ipsum~~ ...

... ... ~~Something~~

## Code
`Lorem` ... ...

... `Ipsum` ...

... ... `Something`

## Bold italic underscore strikethrough
***__~~Lorem~~__*** ... ...

... ***__~~Ipsum~~__*** ...

... ... ***__~~Something~~__***

# Generic markdown in other elements

## Codeblock
Markdown should not be expanded
```
I like *italic* text.
```

## Blockquote
Markdown should be expanded
> *Hello, **World!***
>
> This is __*cool*__.

## Heading
Markdown should be expanded
### __Hey!__
